                <Text style={{ marginTop: 4, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.54)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>拖动旋转、滚轮缩放、点选设备；节点位置可拖动重排。</Text>
