                <Text style={{ marginTop: 4, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.54)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>一键适配视野、聚焦代表链、恢复拓扑布局；标签按视距分级并自动避让。</Text>
